# ── Data safety ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing with real client or holdings data is EVER committed.
# Query results, extracts, and anything exported from SSMS/ADS stay
# out of git. If you need to keep an extract, put it outside the repo.

# Data extracts
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.parquet
*.bak
*.bcp
*.dat

# Power BI files with embedded/imported data.
# Commit .pbit templates (no data) — never .pbix.
*.pbix

# Connection strings & credentials
.env
.env.*
*.dtsConfig
*.rdl.data
*connectionstring*
*connection-string*
*credentials*
secrets.*
*.pfx
*.pem
*.ppk
*.key

# SSMS / editor / OS litter
*.suo
*.ssms_suo
~$*
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
